Caused by: java.lang.ExceptionInInitializerError
Caused by: java.lang.RuntimeException: Failed to start quarkus
Caused by: java.lang.RuntimeException: Failed to initialize Arc
Caused by: java.lang.VerifyError: 
Bad type on operand stack
Exception Details:
  Location:
    org/acme/ExampleResource.hello()Ljava/lang/String; @37: invokevirtual
  Reason:
    Type 'java/lang/Object' (current frame, stack[0]) is not assignable to 'java/lang/Exception'
  Current Frame:
    bci: @37
